  m_Name: Kira_After
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Dialogue.DialogueSequence
  startNodeId: 
  nodes:
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kira sits down on the seat next to the collar. {p}After a while, so do
      I.
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: He sat down like it was nothing. {p}{slow}Like he was saving us seats.{/slow}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: ...
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices:
    - text: '["He made the joke so I''d say yes faster."]'
      nextNodeId: joke
      flagToSet: +openness#after_joke
    - text: '[Say nothing]'
      nextNodeId: quiet
      flagToSet: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: joke
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: Yeah. {p}He was... {p}{slow}he was really good at that.{/slow}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: hospital
  - id: quiet
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: I don't say anything. Kira doesn't make me.
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: It's okay. {p}I'll talk. You can just... be here.
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: hospital
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: At the hospital, when someone left, we weren't allowed to stop. {p}Next
      room. Next tray.
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: So I'm going to do the thing I never did. {p}{slow}I'm going to stop for
      a minute.{/slow}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: The tunnel lights go by. {p}Nobody counts them.
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: Tell me one thing he said that made you laugh. {p}{small}Even a stupid
      one.{/small}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices:
    - text: '[''cats are incredible at being in the way.'']'
      nextNodeId: laugh
      flagToSet: 
    - text: '[''dont pet me. ...ok. once.'']'
      nextNodeId: laugh
      flagToSet: 
    - text: '[''i type in lowercase. its a lifestyle.'']'
      nextNodeId: laugh
      flagToSet: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: laugh
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: '{bounce}Ha.{/bounce} {p}...yeah. {p}{wave}That''s him.{/wave}'
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: 
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d3c4f6749e13c4609beb77b4ac184875, type: 2}
    text: Okay. {p}We keep going. {p}{small}Together. That part's not optional.{/small}
    effect: 0
    requiredFlag: 
    flagToSet: kira_after;+closeness#kira_after
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
